---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of Service — teesh-art">
  <div class="policy">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <p>By placing an order on teesh-art.com, you agree to the following terms.</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>teesh-art sells custom-printed apparel manufactured on demand. This site is operated from Washington State, USA. When you purchase from this site, you are agreeing to be bound by these terms.</p>

    <h2>Products and pricing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>All products are made-to-order and printed upon purchase</li>
      <li>Prices are listed in US dollars and include the cost of production</li>
      <li>Shipping costs, if any, are shown at checkout before payment</li>
      <li>We reserve the right to change pricing at any time without notice (existing orders are not affected)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Orders and fulfillment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Orders are confirmed once payment is successfully processed</li>
      <li>Production typically begins within 1–2 business days of order placement</li>
      <li>Estimated delivery is 5–10 business days (production + shipping), though times may vary</li>
      <li>We currently ship within the United States only</li>
      <li>We are not responsible for delays caused by carriers or customs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>All designs, images, and content on this site are the property of teesh-art or used with permission. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from our designs without written consent.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>teesh-art is provided "as is." To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from purchases</li>
      <li>Issues caused by third-party services (payment processors, shipping carriers, print providers)</li>
      <li>Temporary site unavailability or errors</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you paid for the relevant order.</p>

    <h2>Refunds and replacements</h2>
    <p>Please see our <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a> for details on replacements for defective items.</p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>Your use of this site is also governed by our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Washington, USA. Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of Washington State.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Changes take effect when posted to this page. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Email <strong>support@teesh-art.com</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .policy h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy p {
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  .policy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .policy a {
    color: #2563eb;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
